<title>USA: Sun Healthcare buys Spanish home operator.</title>
<headline>Sun Healthcare buys Spanish home operator.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Healthcare Group Inc on Tuesday said it acquired a majority interest in Eurosar, a privately owned nursing home operator in Spain.</p>
<p>Sun invested about $12 million to acquire a 68.5 percent stake in Eurosar, which operates seven nursing homes with 1,426 beds and has projected 1997 revenues of about $13 million. The balance of Eurosar's ownership is held by its management.</p>
<p>The agreement also provides options for Sun to purchase management's shares, a statement issued by Sun, a diversified international long-term care provider, said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
